<title>FRANCE: French public works outlook seen improving - INSEE.</title>
<headline>French public works outlook seen improving - INSEE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's construction and public works sector should experience a modest recovery in 1997 over 1996, national statistics institute INSEE said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In 1996, the sector's activity fell two percent in volume over 1995.</p>
<p>The jobs outlook was slightly less negative than at the beginning of the year, but 1997 activity will still be hit by the low levels of housing starts in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
